<attribute name="version" nodeId="bb5a29b1"></attribute>
<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="8535a924">&lt;p&gt;
    Implement the training schedule to target audiences by selected trainers in accordance with previously determined
    design and delivery principles. Deliver training via the agreed delivery methods and channels to target audience.
    Create a learning experience for students to maximize comprehension and if possible via practical application of the
    knowledge and skills necessary to operationalize the change tailored to their role(s).
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Confirm that&amp;nbsp;the trainers have reviewed the activities in training checklist worksheets to verify everything
        is covered pre- and post-training.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Deliver training as per the training schedule.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        In each course, verify completion of student assessments and capture the achieved result for each user in
        attendance tracker worksheets.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="ce86ab5"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="7ff73d3a">Check that feedback for the course is received at the end of training course and incorporated into future training courses.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="37cf0942"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="a5373a1c">This task prepares users/stakeholders for operationalizing the change by giving them facilitated support to practice needed
skills to perform their roles; to equip users to understand and embrace new ways of working required by new processes and
systems.</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="58d8d661"></attribute>
</Element>
